    "chapter": 10,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你睡得好吗？\n\n丽丽：啊…好困！\n本：怎么了？昨晚没睡好吗？\n丽丽：是啊！昨晚邻居家开派对，声音太大，我睡不着。\n本：太过分了！\n丽丽：就是啊！你呢？昨晚你睡得好吗？\n本：要考试了，我昨晚在复习，很晚才睡。\n丽丽：那你怎么还那么精神？\n本：因为我早上喝了3杯咖啡。对了，等会儿我们去图书馆吧！\n丽丽：不去。我现在只想睡觉。",
    "traditional": "你睡得好嗎？\n\n麗麗：啊…好睏！\n本：怎麼了？昨晚沒睡好嗎？\n麗麗：是啊！昨晚鄰居家開派對，聲音太大，我睡不著。\n本：太過分了！\n麗麗：就是啊！你呢？昨晚你睡得好嗎？\n本：要考試了，我昨晚在復習，很晚才睡。\n麗麗：那你怎麼還那麼精神？\n本：因為我早上喝了3杯咖啡。對了，等會兒我們去圖書館吧！\n麗麗：不去。我現在只想睡覺。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Did You Sleep Well?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：啊…好困！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：啊…好睏！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì a hǎo kùn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ah… I'm so tired!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：怎么了？昨晚没睡好吗？",
      "traditional": "本：怎麼了？昨晚沒睡好嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn zěn me le zuó wǎn méi shuì hǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: What happened? Did you not sleep well last night?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：是啊！昨晚邻居家开派对，声音太大，我睡不着。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：是啊！昨晚鄰居家開派對，聲音太大，我睡不著。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì shì a zuó wǎn lín jū jiā kāi pài duì shēng yīn tài dà wǒ shuì bu zháo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Exactly! Last night my neighbor had a party. It was so noisy, I couldn't fall asleep."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：太过分了！",
      "traditional": "本：太過分了！",
      "pinyin": "běn tài guò fèn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: That's taking it too far!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：就是啊！你呢？昨晚你睡得好吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：就是啊！你呢？昨晚你睡得好嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì jiù shì a nǐ ne zuó wǎn nǐ shuì de hǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Sure is! What about you? Did you sleep well last night?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：要考试了，我昨晚在复习，很晚才睡。",
      "traditional": "本：要考試了，我昨晚在復習，很晚才睡。",
      "pinyin": "běn yào kǎo shì le wǒ zuó wǎn zài fù xí hěn wǎn cái shuì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I have a test coming up. I was reviewing last night and didn't sleep until late."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那你怎么还那么精神？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那你怎麼還那麼精神？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà nǐ zěn me hái nà me jīng shen",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: So how come you're still so energetic?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：因为我早上喝了3杯咖啡。对了，等会儿我们去图书馆吧！",
      "traditional": "本：因為我早上喝了3杯咖啡。對了，等會兒我們去圖書館吧！",
      "pinyin": "běn yīn wèi wǒ zǎo shang hē le 1 bēi kā fēi duì le děng huì'r wǒ men qù tú shū guǎn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Because I had 3 cups of coffee this morning. Oh right, let's go to the library together in a minute!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "丽丽：不去。我现在只想睡觉。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：不去。我現在只想睡覺。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bú qù wǒ xiàn zài zhǐ xiǎng shuì jiào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I'm not going. Right now I just want to sleep."
    }
  ],
