    "sentence_translations": [
      "Did You Sleep Well?",
      "",
      "Lili: Ah… I'm so tired!",
      "",
      "Ben: What happened? Did you not sleep well last night?",
      "",
      "Lili: Exactly! Last night my neighbor had a party. It was so noisy, I couldn't fall asleep.",
      "",
      "Ben: That's taking it too far!",
      "",
      "Lili: Sure is! What about you? Did you sleep well last night?",
      "",
      "Ben: I have a test coming up. I was reviewing last night and didn't sleep until late.",
      "",
      "Lili: So how come you're still so energetic?",
      "",
      "Ben: Because I had 3 cups of coffee this morning. Oh right, let's go to the library together in a minute!",
      "",
      "Lili: I'm not going. Right now I just want to sleep.",
      ""
    ]
